   "DATA LABELING",
   "03",
   "What is Polyline Annotation?",
   "It is used to annotate long, narrow shapes in an image. It involves placing a series of points along the object and connecting them to follow its path accurately. ",
   "Polyline Annotation and Automated Vehicles (keymakr.com)"
  ],
  "notes": "",
  "img": "assets/day2/polyline/s03.jpg"
 },
 {
  "n": 4,
  "hidden": false,
  "text": [
   "DATA LABELING",
   "03",
   "What is Polyline Annotation?",
   "For example, when marking a road lane, multiple points are placed along the lane and joined to match its direction. This approach is useful for clearly identifying features such as road lanes, railway tracks, and pipelines.",
   "Polyline Annotation and Automated Vehicles (keymakr.com)"
  ],
  "notes": "",
  "img": "assets/day2/polyline/s04.jpg"
 },
